OL,3,GNEWSAWater firm hosts drop-in events
OL,4,Aafter major outage
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnglian Water is hosting two community
OL,7,Fdrop-in sessions in North Lincolnshire
OL,8,Ffollowing a recent water outage which
OL,9,Fleft 36,000 customers in Scunthorpe and
OL,10,Fthe surrounding area with no supply or
OL,11,Flow pressure.
OL,13,FThe firm said it wanted to give
OL,14,Fresidents the opportunity to speak
OL,15,Fdirectly to members of the team about
OL,16,Ftheir experiences.
OL,18,FThe sessions are taking place at the
OL,19,FDiamond Jubilee Town Hall in Kirton in
OL,20,FLindsey between 13:00 and 15:00 and
OL,21,F16:00 and 18:30 BST on Wednesday.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,387,380,200,160,0,100
