OL,3,GNEWSAWater firm hosts drop-in events
OL,4,Aafter major outage
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe aim was to understand how the
OL,7,Fcommunity was affected, what worked
OL,8,Fwell, and what could have been better,
OL,9,Fa spokesperson said.
